\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Thy faithfulness, Lord, each moment we find,
\par So true to Thy word, so loving and kind;
\par Thy mercy so tender to all the lost race,
\par The vilest offender may turn and find grace.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O let me commend my Saviour to you,
\par I set to my seal that Jesus is true:
\par Ye all my find favour who come at His call;
\par O come to my Saviour ! His grace is for all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. To save what was lost, from heaven He came:
\par Come, sinners, and trust in Jesus's name;
\par He offers you pardon, He bids you be free:
\par If sin be your burden, O come unto Me!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Then let us submit His grace to receive,
\par Fall down at His feet and gladly believe:
\par We all are forgiven for Jesus's sake;
\par Our title to heaven His merits we take.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

